# An ALLOW-LIST: nothing reaches the build unless it is named below, so a new secret file, the
# unredacted originals (data/private), a run's outputs or the git history can never end up in
# an image layer.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!src
!scripts
!data/manifest.csv
!data/pages
!ground_truth

# inside what is allowed
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
ground_truth/drafts
